### 2. Prediction History Sidebar
A persistent, collapsible sidebar tracks every prediction made during the session.
- **Instant Access**: Click the 📜 floating button at the bottom right to toggle history.
- **Color-Coded Feedback**: High-risk predictions are highlighted in red for quick identification.
- **Session Continuity**: History is fetched directly from the new `/prediction_history` backend endpoint.

![History Sidebar](C:\Users\pavan\.gemini\antigravity\brain\eb3dae05-b693-4e63-9486-1738120c14a5\.system_generated\click_feedback\click_feedback_1780409542924.png)

### 3. Model Stats & Confusion Matrix
The **Model Stats** tab now includes a professional 2x2 confusion matrix using themed blocks, providing transparency into the model's validation performance (True Positives, False Negatives, etc.).

![Confusion Matrix](C:\Users\pavan\.gemini\antigravity\brain\eb3dae05-b693-4e63-9486-1738120c14a5\.system_generated\click_feedback\click_feedback_1780409654541.png)

### 4. Smart Search & UX Enhancements
- **ID Search**: Directly look up any transaction index (0-284806) from the sidebar.
- **Gauge Marker**: A red threshold tick at 30% on the probability gauge visually clarifies the decision boundary.
- **Onboarding**: A helpful "Ready for Analysis" card replaces the empty state for new users.
- **Export Report**: Generate a detailed `.txt` assessment for any analyzed transaction.

