## 🛠️ Backend & Security Upgrades

- **Performance Caching**: Model predictions are now MD5-hashed and cached in-memory. Identical transactions are served instantly (sub-1ms) without re-running the ensemble.
- **Rate Limiting**: IP-based rate limiting (100 requests/minute by default) protects the API from abuse.
- **SHAP Precision**: Fixed a bug where small values rounded to 0.00%. Now using 6-decimal precision with smart scientific notation formatting in the UI.
- **Actual CSV Parsing**: The bulk upload feature now correctly parses uploaded CSV columns rather than ignoring them.
- **Automated Testing**: Created 7+ unit tests in `tests/test_api.py` covering health checks, filters, predictions, and validation.

## 📁 Updated Project Structure
```text
fraud_detection_api/
├── app.py                  # Added history, caching, rate-limiting, and SHAP fixes
├── config.py               # Added Phase 3 & 4 configuration constants
├── templates/index.html    # Added Analytics, Sidebar, Search, and Confusion Matrix
└── tests/test_api.py       # New! Comprehensive test suite
```

All changes have been successfully implemented and verified in the live browser.
